  <section class="about" id="project-1" tabindex="-1" data-module>
    <div class="about-media">
      <img class="about-components-like" src="resources/components-like-dark.png" alt="Project screenshot: component library interface." width="1036" height="535" loading="eager" decoding="async">
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h3 class="about-heading" data-glitch>How to create components like a PRO</h3>
        <p>Great design or functional code? Why not both?</p>
        <p>A growing collection of design pills packed with practical tips, tricks, and best practices: made to help the design community build better components (and layouts), faster. Ever wondered what separates a basic UI Card from a truly mature Design System component? In this quick guide, we cover:</p>
        <p>• <strong>Auto Layout</strong> structures that adapt effortlessly to any screen size.
        <br>• Clean layer <strong>naming</strong> to make developer inspection a breeze.
        <br>• Flexible <strong>Slots</strong> & swap instances to scale without breaking component logic.</p>

        <div class="project-links">
          <a class="project-link" href="https://www.figma.com/community/file/1672735579552202452" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
