    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h3 class="about-heading" data-glitch>Suggested Micro-Interactions in some components</h3>
        <p>How can small micro-interactions transform a rigid interface into an intuitive flow?</p>
        <p>Component micro-interactions will bring your user interface to life. This guide will help you understand micro-interactions and easily, create them without having to try out all the options Figma offers.</p>
        <p>• <strong>Subtle micro-interactions</strong> to guide the user without causing visual fatigue.
        <br>• <strong>Timing & transitions</strong> designed for a natural screen response.
        <br>• <strong>Visual feedback</strong> using simple yet effective animations.</p>

        <div class="project-links">
