  <section class="about" id="project-3" data-module>
    <div class="about-media">
      <img class="about-watches" src="resources/watches-dark.png" alt="Project screenshot: watch face designs." width="1171" height="746" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h3 class="about-heading" data-glitch>Smartwatch App Screens</h3>
        <p>What does a smartwatch face look like when it strips away everything but the essentials?</p>
        <p>All four screens share a dark-mode minimalist aesthetic featuring dot-matrix digital numbers for primary metrics, subtle themed background gradients (orange, blue, olive green, and vibrant green), and a fixed time display in the top-right corner.</p>
        <p>• <strong>Fitness</strong> tracking, surfaced through core health metrics.
        <br>• <strong>Navigation</strong> guided by GPS, always in view.
        <br>• <strong>Steps</strong> and daily activity summarized at a glance.</p>

